    "title": "Blitz Breakdown Dark horses, Week 7 predictions for RI football games",
    "text": "Don't miss this week's Blitz Breakdown - dark horses, Week 7 predictions and more!\nWPRI's JP Smollins returns to the Blitz Breakdown as he and The Journal's Eric Rueb take a look back at Week 6's games, highlighting Woonsocket's big comeback win over Pawtucket to re-ignite their playoff hopes, and La Salle asserting its dominance over St. Raphael in a Division I clash.\nThe guys then take their shot at who they think are the dark horse candidates to reach Super Bowls this season. Can Portsmouth keep its magic going against the top-tier teams in Division I? Is St. Raphael, despite its loss last week, able to bounce back and reach the title game? How about East Providence or Woonsocket in Division II; Is North Providence going to put it all together in Division III, and how about Davies in Division IV?\nIn the final segment, Rueb, Smollins and WPRI producer Jillian make their predictions for Week 7 games. Don't miss it!",
